      <sourceDesc>
	<p xml:lang="sl">Knjige v digitalni obliki, ki sestavljajo ta korpus, so bile nabrane iz raznih virov (dLib, Google books, Wikivir), kjer je bilo potrebno, so bili OCR tudi ročno popravljeni. Točen vir je podan v kolofonu vsakega posameznega besedila korpusa.</p>
	<p xml:lang="en">The digital books comprising this corpus were collected from various sources (dLib, Google books, Wikisource). The exact digital source is given in the TEI header of each corpus text.</p>
      </sourceDesc>
    </fileDesc>
    <encodingDesc>
      <projectDesc>
        <p xml:lang="sl">Namen projekta <q><ref target="https://www.zrc-sazu.si/sl/programi-in-projekti/izhodisca-slovenske-pripovedne-proze">Izhodišča slovenske pripovedne proze</ref></q> je prevetritev in dopolnitev pogledov na razvoj slovenske pripovedne literature do prve (izvirne) slovenske pripovedi. Tradicionalno literanovedno raziskovanje je nadgrajeno z analizo z računalniškimi stilometričnimi orodij, zato smo oblikovali korpus pripovednih besedil od Adama Skalarja do Janeza Ciglerja.</p>
        <p xml:lang="en">The project <q><ref target="https://www.zrc-sazu.si/en/programi-in-projekti/the-bases-of-slovenian-narrative-prose">The basis of Slovenian narrative prose</ref></q> examines and expands the currently established views on the developments of Slovenian narrative to the first (original) Slovenian narrative prose. Traditional literary research is upgraded with computer based stylometric analysis. In order to perform this analysis, we compiled this corpus of selected narrative texts in Slovene from Adam Skalar to Janez Cigler.</p>
      </projectDesc>
    </encodingDesc>
